  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「おっと！　ピヨちゃん、し～っ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「はわわっ、どうしたんですか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「話の途中ですが……足音がしましたっ、忍び足だったんで気づくのが遅れました！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「なかなかの足運びですね～、これは武道の経験者ですぜ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「あ、足音だけで『そんなこと』までわかるんですか……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「普通わかりません？　とにかく、樽に蓋をしますんで。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「声をひそめて、気配を消してください！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「ぶ、ぶちょうさんとジョンさんはどうするんですぅ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「蓋のあいた樽がひとつしかないから、ピヨちゃんしか隠れられません」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「この樽には、あっしやジョンくんが収まる隙間はないですしね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「他に隠れられる場所も、どうも見当たりません」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「さいあく、あっしが犠牲になってもピヨちゃんだけは生き延びてほしい！　恩人ですからねっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「犠牲とか生き延びるとか不穏な単語ですぅ……ど、どういうことですかぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「実は『密航者コース』を選んだ乗客は、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「他の人間に見つかってはならない、というルールがあるんです！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「あくまで、『密航者』という立場を演じてるわけですからな！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「他の人間に見つかったとき、どういう扱いを受けるかはわかりませんが……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「ふつう船で『密航者』が発見されたら、海に叩き落とされますよね☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「ま、まさかそんな……？　こ、怖いですぅ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「だぁいじょうぶ、あっしがバッチリ守りますって☆　せめて、ピヨちゃんだけは！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「ね～、ジョンくん♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「はうう、いつの間にか仲良くなってますぅ。転こ……ジョンさんって、そういうところありますよね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「底知れないひとですぅ、誰とでもすぐ親しくなれるのは羨ましいですけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「いやぁ♪　最初はどこの馬の骨かと思いましたが、あっしはジョンくんのこと気にいりました！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「言うこと何でもおとなしく聞いてくれるし、あっしの好きなタイプですぜ！　部下にほしい♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「それはいいですけど……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「ますます理解できないのは、なぜあえてそんな茨の道っぽい『密航者コース』を選んだかなんですけど？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「ええ。上位ランク……『賓客コース』『一般客コース』は、どうも定員が決まっているようでして」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「『賓客コース』は一枚のチケットで一名まで、『一般客コース』は二名まで！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「あっしらは三名ですからね～、定員が無制限らしい『密航者コース』を選ぶしかなかったんですぜ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「うう、わたしだけなら『賓客コース』を選べたんですね……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「そこはほんと、申し訳ないです！　平身低頭、謝りますぜ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「でもでも、気絶したピヨちゃんを運ぶのは、あっしの腕力だけでは無理で！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「ジョンくんにも、手伝ってもらうしかなかったんですぜ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「それはむしろ、巻きこんでごめんなさいジョンさん……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「まぁ、巡りあわせですね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「仕方ないですぅ。自分の立場を受けいれて、そのなかで努力するしかないですね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「『密航者』なんて……ある意味、ふつうに船に乗るより楽しそうですぅ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「おぉ、ピヨちゃんは見かけによらず前向きですねっ☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「えへへ。常にうちの部長に振り回されてるので、ひどい扱いには慣れっこですぅ……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「まぁ、ひとまず現状は把握できたと思いますぅ。成りゆきですが、二泊三日の船旅……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「同じ『密航者』として、仲良くしましょう♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「げっ、二泊三日なんですかい？　初めて聞いた！　どうしよう、合宿が終わっちゃう！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「まぁいいか、これはこれで良い経験になりそう！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「あっしが部長になったとき、その経験を活かしますぜ☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「大船に乗ったつもりで、あっしに頼ってくださいね！　ピヨちゃん♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「……おっと。近づいてた足音が止まりました、この部屋に入ってくるかも？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「ジョンくん、樽の陰に隠れましょう。この際です、ぎゅうって密着しても構いませんぜ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「えっと、そういえば……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「わたし樽の外がよく見えないのでわからないんですけど、ここって何の部屋なんですぅ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「どうやら、厨房のようですね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「だから林檎の詰まった樽……つまり、食材が置かれてるわけですけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「あっしら『密航者』は各々、最初に乗船してから十分間だけは自由に動けたんです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「その間は、『密航者』は他の人間から『見ないふり』されてました。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
